    "descEn": "Ultra-luxury watch store with 3D product showcase, strap material switcher, currency converter, slide-out cart and instant checkout.",
    "descFr": "Boutique horlogère de luxe avec configurateur de bracelets, conversion multi-devises, panier tiroir et checkout.",
